License status of this local release candidate
=============================================

The license for the authors' original contributions has not yet been selected.
This file does not grant a new license or relicense third-party material.
Public redistribution is pending the permissions described in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The inherited FlowMRI-Net / organizer FlowVN MIT notice is preserved in
licenses/FlowMRI-Net-MIT.txt. Other applicable upstream notices are preserved
in licenses/. These notices apply to their respective components; they do not
establish a blanket MIT license for this entire candidate.

The phase-correction module has separately stated noncommercial terms, and the
organizer's shared utility files require clarification of redistribution rights.
Paper publication rights, challenge data access, and checkpoint redistribution
are separate from software licensing.
